<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Salomon downgrades Valero.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Salomon downgrades Valero.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Salomon Brothers analyst Paul Ting said he downgraded Valero Energy Corp to hold from buy on price.</p>
<p>--He cited a 45 percent increase in the company's share price over the past few months.</p>
<p>--Valero agreed on Friday to be acquired by PG&amp;E Corp in a $1.5 billion transaction. The deal does not include Valero's refining subsidiary, which is slated to be spun off.</p>
<p>--Shares of Valero fell 2-3/4 to 31.</p>
</text>
